    {"slug":"energy","icon":"☀","eyebrow":"Powering a cleaner future","name":"Renewable Energy","summary":"Saudi Arabia is turning its abundant sun and wind into a new energy mix.","description":"Saudi Arabia is investing in solar, wind and clean hydrogen as it diversifies its energy mix. National projects include utility-scale plants, research initiatives and infrastructure that support innovation and local expertise.","examples":["Sakaka Solar Power Plant","Dumat Al Jandal Wind Farm","Clean hydrogen initiatives"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509391366360-2e959784a276?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#d8a742","fact":"The Kingdom’s sun and wind resources support a more diverse energy mix."},
    {"slug":"petrochemicals","icon":"◈","eyebrow":"From resources to products","name":"Petrochemicals","summary":"Materials found in everyday life, from packaging and medicine to cars and construction.","description":"Saudi petrochemicals grew from the Kingdom’s resource base, energy and industrial infrastructure. Plants produce basic and specialty materials used across downstream industries, while the sector works to improve efficiency and develop higher-value products.","examples":["Polymers and plastics","Fertilizers and chemicals","Specialty materials for manufacturing"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513828583688-c52646db42da?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#7bb8ad","fact":"Industrial clusters connect basic materials with downstream manufacturing."},
    {"slug":"mining","icon":"⬡","eyebrow":"Resources beneath our feet","name":"Mining & Minerals","summary":"Geological resources create opportunities for industry, jobs and investment.","description":"The Arabian Shield stretches across much of western Saudi Arabia and contains a range of mineral resources. The sector is developing exploration, mining and mineral processing, including phosphate, gold, aluminium and industrial minerals.","examples":["Phosphate and fertilizers","Gold and base metals","Aluminium and industrial minerals"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516937941344-00b4e0337589?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#d8875b","fact":"The national strategy aims to make mining a third pillar of Saudi industry."},
    {"slug":"pharma","icon":"✚","eyebrow":"Healthcare made closer to home","name":"Pharmaceuticals","summary":"Local capabilities in medicines and medical supplies strengthen health resilience.","description":"Saudi Arabia has pharmaceutical and medical-product factories and is growing local manufacturing and knowledge transfer across health supply chains. The sector includes medicines, solutions, medical supplies and advanced biopharmaceutical products.","examples":["Generic medicines","Solutions and medical preparations","Biomanufacturing and health technologies"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#a987c2","fact":"A diverse local supply base can make healthcare supply chains more resilient."},
    {"slug":"food","icon":"❋","eyebrow":"Food made from our land","name":"Food Industries","summary":"From dates and dairy to the products that reach our tables every day.","description":"Food manufacturing connects agriculture with processing, packaging and distribution. Saudi products such as dates and dairy sit alongside a broad food sector investing in preservation, quality and safety.","examples":["Dates and date products","Dairy and food manufacturing","Packaging and food preservation"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542838132-92c53300491e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#d9a54a","fact":"Saudi dates are among the country’s products with a strong local and global presence."},
    {"slug":"mobility","icon":"↗","eyebrow":"A new direction for mobility","name":"Automotive & Mobility","summary":"Saudi Arabia is building local capacity for electric vehicles and their supply chains.","description":"The mobility sector is changing as local vehicle manufacturing, assembly and component supply chains develop. National projects aim to connect manufacturing, services, skills and charging infrastructure.","examples":["Electric vehicle manufacturing","Components and supply chains","Charging infrastructure"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593941707882-a5bba14938c7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#72a6ce","fact":"National initiatives aim to localize vehicle manufacturing and related technologies."},
    {"slug":"defense","icon":"⬢","eyebrow":"Building advanced national capabilities","name":"Defence Industries","summary":"Localizing advanced technologies and developing a specialized industrial base.","description":"Saudi Arabia is localizing military industries and services while building national capabilities in manufacturing, maintenance and defence technologies. The sector depends on skills development, partnerships and technology transfer.","examples":["Maintenance, repair and operations","Defence systems and components","Advanced communications and technologies"],"image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092921461-eab62e97a780?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85","color":"#a5af7d","fact":"Saudi Arabia aims to localize more than 50% of military spending by 2030."},
